---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn about GoreeWorks, its mission, origin, ownership philosophy, and company identity.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="site-shell">
      <span class="eyebrow">About GoreeWorks</span>
      <h1 class="display" style="max-width:64rem; margin-top:1rem">Creativity meets technology.</h1>
      <p class="lede">GoreeWorks is a creative technology and product company focused on building, designing, and delivering useful products, software, experiences, and ideas.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="site-shell grid-2">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Mission</span><h2 class="heading" style="margin-top:1rem">Build with intention.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>GoreeWorks exists to build things that are useful, meaningful, and thoughtfully designed.</p><p>The company focuses on creating products, software, experiences, and solutions built with intention.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="site-shell grid-2">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Origin</span><h2 class="heading" style="margin-top:1rem">From a design foundation to a broader vision.</h2></div>
      <div class="prose"><p>The entrepreneurial journey began with Digital Brain Graphics, building experience across design, digital products, printing, websites, ecommerce, customer interaction, and online business operations.</p><p>As that work expanded into web development, self-hosting, software, applications, infrastructure, and automation, GoreeWorks became the identity for the next chapter.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-rule">
    <div class="site-shell">
      <span class="eyebrow">Company identity</span>
      <h2 class="heading" style="margin-top:1rem; max-width:52rem">Modern, independent, human, thoughtful.</h2>
      <div class="tag-list" aria-label="Brand identity traits">
        <span class="tag">Creative</span><span class="tag">Modern</span><span class="tag">Independent</span><span class="tag">Premium</span><span class="tag">Innovative</span><span class="tag">Human</span><span class="tag">Thoughtful</span><span class="tag">Reliable</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section compact">
    <div class="site-shell callout">
      <p class="statement">GoreeWorks is the company for creating. <em>It is where ideas become products.</em></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
